user-attachments/assets/5d276089-42e4-4cd6-982f-8b2a04483369)\nNo lags, but memory grow.\n\nAlways object count return to normal, static memory growing.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nLaunch project. Spawn units,clear units. 1000  units create and remove for visible effect, if area and body layer == 1 - 300 units for visible effect\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[pro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19451712/pro.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104612/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}